Using the idea of knowledge distillation for faster inference;
Redesigning the typical image encoder form of SAM models which leads to on par performance but much more time efficiency; 
Changing the typical logit-level knowledge distillation to a layer-wise procedure
Using a 3d sparse attention instead of typical self-attention which contributions mainly to the inefficiency of transformers in terms of time/computation complexity;
good performance improvements compared to SOTA methods;

