reviews.text_weaknesses:
lack of clarity in the description of methods, especially in the Textual Inversion section;
fewer comparison experiments, at least compare some newer articles (e.g., methods that use large models);
the experimental details section should explain the specific settings of Image Encoder, Textual Inversion and Text Decoder;
insufficient settings for ablation experiments;

